<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh April inflation steady at 0.8 pct monthly.</title>
<headline>Kazakh April inflation steady at 0.8 pct monthly.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's consumer price inflation was unchanged at 0.8 percent in April compared to the previous month, the National Statistics Agency said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH CONSUMER PRICES     Apr '97     Mar '97     Apr '96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +0.8	  +0.8	  +3.8</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +21.5	 +24.1	 +42.2</p>
<p>Kazakh officials have said this year's annual inflation would fall to 15-17 percent from 28.7 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
